# CODE NAME - environment template.
# Copy this file to ".env" for non-secret local configuration only.
#
# Do not put API keys in VITE_* variables. Vite exposes VITE_ values to the
# frontend/webview, so they are not supported for runtime secret storage.
#
# Use the in-app Secrets panel instead. It writes provider keys to the OS
# keychain, and Rust reads them only from backend-owned provider paths.
#
# Deprecated examples kept as comments only. Do not uncomment these:
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY="unsupported-do-not-use"
# VITE_OLLAMA_API_KEY="unsupported-do-not-use"
